  "dish_name": "Hidden Gourmet Delight",
  "strategy": "Creating a unique and delicious dish by incorporating disliked ingredients in a way that hides their identity while enhancing the overall taste and texture.",
  "content": "To prepare Hidden Gourmet Delight, start by washing and slicing the zucchinis. In a mixing bowl, combine the zucchini slices with finely diced onions and beaten egg whites. Add crumbled sausage, breadcrumbs, and parsley. Mix everything well. Shape the mixture into small patties. In a non-stick pan, heat some olive oil and cook the patties on both sides until golden brown. Serve with a side of spicy tomato sauce made from canned tomatoes, garlic, red pepper flakes, and herbs. The zucchini is well-hidden in the patties, providing a nutritious and unexpected surprise for those who dislike it."
}

